  {
    "__type__": "cc.RichText",
    "_name": "",
    "_objFlags": 0,
    "node": {
      "__id__": 2262
    },
    "_enabled": true,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_isSystemFontUsed": true,
    "_N$string": "  1.The \"Star Card\" has a chance to trigger its effect after the completion of \"second to fourth prize matching\" in each spin and after the completion of card replenishment.\n  2.The \"Star Card\" will definitely trigger its effect after the completion of \"fifth prize matching and beyond\" in each spin and after the completion of card replenishment.\n  3.The effect of the \"Star Card\" is to randomly transform the \"regular playing cards\" of the 2nd, 3rd, and 4th rounds into \"golden playing cards\".",
    "_N$horizontalAlign": 0,
    "_N$fontSize": 27,
    "_N$font": null,
    "_N$cacheMode": 0,
    "_N$maxWidth": 830,
    "_N$lineHeight": 50,
    "_N$imageAtlas": null,
    "_N$handleTouchEvent": true,
    "_id": "76Q6pg7LJDt4cO/OcQODT9"
