  {
    "__type__": "cc.RichText",
    "_name": "",
    "_objFlags": 0,
    "node": {
      "__id__": 2325
    },
    "_enabled": true,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_isSystemFontUsed": true,
    "_N$string": "  1.If 3 or more \" <img src='p_00'/> \" appear(no pay ways needed) will trigger the Free Game with 10 free spins. Free game was start after all winning symbols were elimated and no win.\n  2.\"The Combo Multiplier\" has 5 levels as x2, x4, x6, x10, x20 in Free Game.\n  3.Points won each matching will be multiplied based on the current \"Combo Multiplier\"\n  4.The Multiplier is increased to x2 for \"The First Matching\" of each spin.\n  5.The Multiplier is increased to x4 for \"The Second Matching\" of each spin.\n  6.The Multiplier is increased to x6 for \"The Third Matching\" of each spin.\n  7.The Multiplier is increased to x10 for \"The Fourth\" of each spin.\n  8.The Multiplier is increased to the final level x20 for \"The Fiveth or more Matching\" of each spin.\n  9.If the symbols do not match, the \"Combo Multiplier\" resets to x2 .\n  10.If there is a win at a free game (after the winning symbols disappearing and the new symbols falling down for the replacement),all the symbols on screen are potential to win with combo multiplier for the second, third, fourth, fifth ,sixth or more matching,and so on if any winning way is awarded.\n  11.Rules of \"Combo Multiplier\" are the same as the main game, only the \"Combo Multiplier\" values are twice that of the main game.\n  12.Additional five free spins are given when three or more <img src='p_00'/> appear, and this will only award once during each single free spin even re-evaluated multiple times\n  13.During the free game, 3 or more <img src='p_00'/> would be re-evaluated multiple times in a single spin with multiple points won matchings.",
    "_N$horizontalAlign": 0,
    "_N$fontSize": 27,
    "_N$font": null,
    "_N$cacheMode": 0,
    "_N$maxWidth": 830,
    "_N$lineHeight": 50,
    "_N$imageAtlas": {
      "__uuid__": "bce30549-9b89-46e5-a272-f50965934513"
    },
    "_N$handleTouchEvent": true,
    "_id": "f3q25+q9tA5qoP7J5dmLS8"
  },
