  {
    "__type__": "cc.RichText",
    "_name": "",
    "_objFlags": 0,
    "node": {
      "__id__": 2334
    },
    "_enabled": true,
    "_fontFamily": "Arial",
    "_isSystemFontUsed": true,
    "_N$string": "1.This is a video slot with 5 reels, 4 rows and 1024 ways.\n  2.All wins begin with leftmost reel and pay left to right on adjacent reels.\n  3.Winning symbols can occur anywhere on all reels.\n  4.The Cascading reels rule where if there is a win the winning symbols are removed and new symbols will appear on their places for additional wins within the same wager and the process is repeated until there is no win.\n  5.The normal symbols(except <img src = 'p_00'/>) of each reel in each winning combination would be calculated once.\n  6.Coinciding wins are added.\n  7.Only the maximum amount of winnings on each way will be paid out.\n  8.Each spin has a maximum payout ratio of 10,000 times. When this ratio is reached, the continuous matching for prize will stop, and the reward settlement will proceed.\n  9.Winning combinations and pays are made according to the paytable.",
    "_N$horizontalAlign": 0,
    "_N$fontSize": 27,
    "_N$font": null,
    "_N$cacheMode": 0,
    "_N$maxWidth": 830,
    "_N$lineHeight": 50,
    "_N$imageAtlas": {
